        "Design file structure and test strategy"
      ],
      "prompt": {
        "template": "Design a REST endpoint based on existing codebase patterns.\n\n**Endpoint Specification**:\n- Path: {{endpoint_path}}\n- Method: {{http_method}}\n- Purpose: {{endpoint_description}}\n\n**Your Task**: Design the endpoint architecture and create ENDPOINT_DESIGN.md",
